(Let's see what needed to dispatch shift_candidate_alpha.)
(To dispatch a candidate (schedule_candidate), we have action execute_schedule_dispatch with parameters (?candidate - schedule_candidate ?vehicle_unit - vehicle_unit ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot). Precondition:)
(- (dispatch_allocated ?candidate))
(- (candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit))
(- (candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot))
(- (not (dispatched ?candidate)))
(Effect: (dispatched ?candidate) and (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit) and (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot).)
(Thus we need to have dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_vehicle_linked with some vehicle unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked with dispatch_slot_alpha.)
(Dispatch_allocated comes from action allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (parameters ?candidate - candidate_entity ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile). Precondition:)
(- (dispatch_ready ?candidate))
(- (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile))
(- (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot))
(- (not (dispatch_allocated ?candidate)))
(Effect: (dispatch_allocated ?candidate) and (candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot) and (not (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot)))
(Thus we need dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha with some route_task_profile (route_task_profile_alpha is available), and dispatch_slot_available (we have initially). Also not dispatch_allocated.)
(dispatch_ready for schedule_candidate can be achieved via finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation or finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation or finalize_candidate_direct. Those give dispatch_ready as effect.)
(Specifically finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation: parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate. Precondition: (compliance_validation_complete ?candidate) and (not (candidate_finalized ?candidate)). Effect: (candidate_finalized ?candidate) and (dispatch_ready ?candidate).)
(Thus we need compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha and not candidate_finalized. Then we can finalize to get dispatch_ready.)
(Compliance_validation_complete can be achieved via verify_compliance_certificate: parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate ?compliance_certificate - compliance_certificate. Precondition: (operator_alignment_confirmed ?candidate) and (candidate_compliance_certificate_linked ?candidate ?compliance_certificate) and (not (compliance_validation_complete ?candidate)). Effect: (compliance_validation_complete ?candidate).)
(Thus we need operator_alignment_confirmed shift_candidate_alpha and candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha with compliance_certificate_alpha.)
(Operator_alignment_confirmed from confirm_operator_alignment: parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate ?operator_resource - operator_resource. Precondition: (constraint_applied ?candidate) and (candidate_operator_linked ?candidate ?operator_resource) and (not (operator_alignment_confirmed ?candidate)). Effect: (operator_alignment_confirmed ?candidate).)
(Thus we need constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha and candidate_operator_linked shift_candidate_alpha with driver_operator_alpha.)
(Constraint_applied from apply_operational_constraint: parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate ?operational_constraint - operational_constraint ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Precondition: (candidate_prepared ?candidate) and (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile) and (operational_constraint_available ?operational_constraint) and (candidate_operational_constraint_linked ?candidate ?operational_constraint) and (not (constraint_applied ?candidate)). Effect: (constraint_applied ?candidate) and (not (operational_constraint_available ?operational_constraint)).)
(Thus we need candidate_prepared shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha with route_task_profile_alpha, operational_constraint_available (we have operational_constraint_alpha initially), candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_alpha with operational_constraint_alpha (we have that initially), and not constraint_applied.)
(Candidate_prepared from confirm_candidate_preparedness: parameters ?candidate - candidate_entity ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Precondition: (candidate_created ?candidate) and (vehicle_allocated ?candidate) and (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile) and (not (candidate_prepared ?candidate)). Effect: (candidate_prepared ?candidate).)
(Thus we need candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha, vehicle_allocated shift_candidate_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha with route_task_profile_alpha.)
(Vehicle_allocated from allocate_vehicle_unit: parameters ?candidate - candidate_entity ?vehicle_unit - vehicle_unit. Precondition: (candidate_created ?candidate) and (not (vehicle_allocated ?candidate)) and (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit). Effect: (vehicle_allocated ?candidate) and (candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit) and (not (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit)).)
(Thus we need candidate_created shift_candidate_alpha and a vehicle available.)
(Candidate_created from create_candidate: parameters ?candidate - candidate_entity. Precondition: (not (candidate_created ?candidate)) and (not (dispatched ?candidate)). Effect: (candidate_created ?candidate).)
(Thus we need to create shift_candidate_alpha first.)
(Also need candidate_task_profile_linked shift_candidate_alpha with route_task_profile_alpha: from attach_task_profile: parameters ?candidate - candidate_entity ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Precondition: (candidate_created ?candidate) and (vehicle_allocated ?candidate) and (route_task_profile_available ?route_task_profile). Effect: (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile) and (not (route_task_profile_available ?route_task_profile)). So after vehicle allocated, we can attach task profile.)
